## What a later layer found

{{.inputs.findings}}

A later layer could not deliver what these features promise. Change the features so that they can be delivered, or split the feature whose promise cannot be kept. Stay at the feature's altitude: the fix is a different or smaller outcome, never the pattern the later layer wished for. Re-emit `features`, `feature_docs`, `doc_paths` and `questions` in full.

## The critique could not close these

{{.inputs.findings}}

Turn every finding you cannot settle from the docs into a `questions` entry, in the shape the brief gave. Settle from the docs what the docs settle. Re-emit `features`, `feature_docs` and `doc_paths` in full, and `responses` with each finding `blocked` and its question named.

